  "summary": "Coupe (19437) rear deck air exhaust: the rear grille / rear plenum shut-off doors (air-outlet louver doors in the rear deck behind the rear window) and the vacuum actuator that opens them, plus the air outlet panel (A/OTLT) on the deck. The vacuum actuator bolts to a support that screws to the door frame; a rod links it to the doors through riveted guides; the door gaskets are cemented on. Related sheet: F19 (C/O).",
